    // Arc 111 — three states surfaced at the type level:
    //   recv: Result<Option<T>, ThreadDiedError>
    //         Ok(Some v)      — value flowed
    //         Ok(:None)       — clean shutdown (every sender dropped via scope)
    //         Err(ThreadDied) — sender thread panicked
